Brand & Support Channels (reserved, NOT covered by MIT)

The following identity and channel assets are reserved to
YCH81 (Jeff Hu) personally and are NOT covered by the MIT License
above. They are NOT part of the "Software" granted under that license.

  - The name "LociiGhost" and any visually-confusingly-similar variant.
  - The LociiGhost icon set (paper-plane / sage palette).
  - The author's personal donation channel: Ko-fi at
    https://ko-fi.com/jflociighost
  - The author's personal contact channels: LINE Official Account
    @382ydavk and the LINE community group "LociiGhost Mac/iOS 飛人".

If you fork, modify, or redistribute LociiGhost in any form, you MUST:

  1. Rename your fork (do not call it "LociiGhost" or any name a
     reasonable user would confuse with LociiGhost), and use a
     different icon set.
  2. Remove or replace every reference to the author's personal
     donation / contact channels listed above. Substituting your
     own donation / contact channels is fine; passing the originals
     off as your own, or leaving them in place to funnel support
     intended for YCH81 to a third party, is not.

This brand carve-out is independent of the MIT grant: the source
code itself remains MIT-licensed and freely modifiable. What is
reserved is the project's *identity* and the author's *personal
funnels*, both of which the MIT License does not (and is not designed
to) cover.
